<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Hewlett-Packard's dual samurais.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ to Hewlett-Packard's dual samurais.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp said on Tuesday it had assigned an AA+ rating to Hewlett-Packard Co's 30 billion yen worth of 5.0 percent dual currency yen/U.S. dollar samurai bonds due on October 28, 1999.</p>
</text>
